## Step 2: Fuzz Remote Fetching Fields
If an application feature pulls an image file or references an outside endpoint by its URL path, target that parameter:

ffuf -w ssrf_payloads.txt -u https://1win.com -X GET -H "Cookie: session=YOUR_SESSION_COOKIE" -t 1 -rate 5


* How to Verify: Compare response times (-rt) or response sizes (-s). If calling an internal port (like 127.0.0.1:8080) changes response sizes compared to a dead port, the backend machine is attempting to route internal connections locally. [5] 

